WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
In the future, Europe will generate
 more energy from the sea

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The wind, waves, tides, 
algae - and the sun 

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
can produce clean renewable energy

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
This will help us reach 
our 2030 climate targets 

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.500
and make Europe 
climate neutral by 2050 

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.000
The EU is a global leader
 in offshore renewable energies – 

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
an area where we can
 invest, grow, and export 

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.000
our knowledge and products
 to the rest of the world 

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.600
The European Commission’s Offshore 
Renewable Energy Strategy

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.600
protects the environment 
and biodiversity 

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.650
promotes sustainable 
multi-use of the sea 

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.200
increases the production
 of clean and renewable energy

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.150
supports European industry 

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:00.000
creates green jobs

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
#EUGreenDeal

